# Stage 7d's criterion (TASK-24, docs/research/desktop/plan.md, ADR-0168,
# ADR-0172): a second terminal starts from the panel with the handles its
# launch record lists, hidden windows restore from the panel's dock, a room
# made in the shell appears in the dock and a terminal launched in it is
# in the room. Coordinates are logical at scale 1 (1024 x 768): the first
# terminal's frame at (72, 70), each next one 32 further right and down;
# the dock's icons from y 702, their dots at y 745, the chips' dots at
# y 722 (zoraya_compositor::rooms). Colours: fg.text.secondary 5b5f67
# (home's dot), room.1 2f7f8f (the first room), bg.frame.focused f7f7f8,
# and d3e1e5 that ground with room.1 at TITLE_TINT (46 of 255).
serial init: gui: gpu on its own page
screen Type help to begin, or help tour.
screen ~> _
# The terminal's icon, its home dot, and its tooltip under the pointer.
pointc 5b5f67 200 743 600 5
shot dock
# A second terminal from the panel (System+Enter), in home. Its shell holds
# what its launch record lists: the console, its job, the image directory,
# the volume's root and its terminal, and no power at slot 4; what follows
# (a memory object, a port) is the shell's own.
chord meta ret
origin 105 138
screen Type help to begin, or help tour.
screen ~> _
# A new window takes focus only from the person (ADR-0094): its title bar,
# then its focused ground (bg.frame.focused) before any key.
click 400 120
region 162 108 100 4 f7f7f8
type slots\r
prefix slots: 1:console 2:job 3:directory 5:channel 6:channel 7:
screen ~> _
# Both hidden by their dashes; the dock's icon brings them back in their
# stacking order, the first on top and focused.
click 146 120
click 114 88
clickc 5b5f67 200 743 600 5
origin 73 106
type echo back\r
screen back
screen ~> _
# A room made in the shell (ADR-0172 point 3): written to /config/rooms,
# read by the panel, shown as a chip. An untrusted one waits for quotas.
type mkdir project\r
screen ~> _
type room new project +w ~/project +r /system\r
screen project --colour 1 +w ~/project +r /system
screen ~> _
type room new agent-1 --untrusted +w ~/sandbox\r
prefix room: agent-1: untrusted rooms wait for quotas
# The chip enters the room; System+Enter launches a terminal in it.
clickc 2f7f8f 300 719 600 7
chord meta ret
origin 137 170
screen Type help to begin, or help tour.
screen project ~/project> _
click 450 152
# The focused ground tinted by room.1 (ADR-0172 point 5).
region 194 140 100 4 d3e1e5
type room\r
screen * project  +w ~/project  +r /system
shot rooms
# Show-commands: every icon and chip with its line.
chord meta slash
shot commands
chord meta slash
# The first terminal's shell turns the machine off.
click 400 80
region 130 76 100 4 f7f7f8
origin 73 106
type poweroff\r
exit
